msgctxt "116"
msgid ""
"Kiryu! Sorry, but I'm in a real tough spot! Get over here\r\n"
"as quick as you can!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "128"
msgid "Nakahara, what's wrong? Where are you?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "140"
msgid "Mikio's father's res⑬"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "152"
msgid "*click* *beep* *beep*"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "164"
msgid "Hey! Nakahara! What happened!?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "212"
msgid "(Damn. That didn't sound good at all!)"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "236"
msgid "Oh, Kiryu, sir. What brings you here?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "248"
msgid "Mikio! Nakahara's not with you!?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "260"
msgid ""
"Huh? The old man's not back yet? Maybe he's still at\r\n"
"Morning Glory."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "272"
msgid ""
"No, he just called. I don't know the details, but it sounds\r\n"
"like he's in trouble."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "284"
msgid ""
"What!? Really!? Maybe it has something to do with all those\r\n"
"cars..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "296"
msgid "Cars? What cars?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "308"
msgid ""
"I just saw a line of big, black cars go down\r\n"
"Ryukyu Boulevard. I'm pretty sure they turned\r\n"
"onto Kitaryu Street."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "320"
msgid "Kitaryu Street? Are you sure?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "332"
msgid ""
"Yeah. That's where my old man's restaurant is.\r\n"
"Oh! And by \"old man,\" I mean my pops, not\r\n"
"Old Man Nakahara."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "344"
msgid "That's it!"
msgstr "Così!"

msgctxt "356"
msgid "What do you mean?"
msgstr "Cosa intendi?"

msgctxt "368"
msgid "Nakahara's gotta be there. Come on, Mikio! Lead the way!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "380"
msgid "What the!?"
msgstr "Ma che!?"

msgctxt "404"
msgid ""
"(Mikio's not here. Maybe he's still at Morning Glory\r\n"
"with Nakahara.)"
msgstr ""

